{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41860","headline":"舟中望九华山 · 李中","name":"舟中望九华山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"排空苍翠异，辍櫂看崔嵬。\n一面雨初歇，九峰云正开。\n当时思水石，便欲上楼台。\n隐去心难遂，吟余首懒回。\n僧休传紫阁，屏歇写天台。\n中有忘机者，逍遥不可陪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41860.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41860","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}